---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About — stefumies." description="About Steve Davies, software developer." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>About</h1>
			<p>
				I'm a self-taught, dedicated, and versatile developer with a deep passion for code. I thrive
				on new challenges and enjoy diving into unfamiliar territory — especially when there's a steep
				learning curve. I pick up new technologies and programming languages quickly.
			</p>
			<p>
				With over 20 years in software development, I started in Project Management before moving into
				software design and coding. My journey began with Java and the JVM, which remain my core
				strengths. I'm a certified Spring Professional and have hands-on experience with JavaScript and
				its ecosystem, particularly React and Angular. I've worked across stacks using Spring/Spring Boot,
				Nest, and Node, and have deployed to cloud platforms like AWS and GCP. I'm also well-versed in
				standard build tools.
			</p>
			<p>
				I'm especially drawn to programming languages and paradigms, and I aim to apply solid principles
				in my day-to-day development. I enjoy both functional and traditional approaches — I regularly
				work on personal projects in Clojure on the JVM, C, and enjoy designing solutions in emerging
				languages such as Odin.
			</p>
			<p>
				You can reach me at <a href="mailto:stefumies@outlook.com">stefumies@outlook.com</a> or find
				me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/stevemdavies/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
